## Trademark carve-out: the EDHEC logo is not covered

The MIT licence above covers the code, the stylesheets, the templates and the
documentation in this repository. It does **not** cover the EDHEC Business
School name, logo or visual identity.

`design/edhec-logo.svg` is the official mark, obtained from
`edhec.edu/sites/default/files/logo.svg`. It is EDHEC Business School's
trademark. It is included here, and embedded in the templates, so that members
of EDHEC can produce EDHEC-branded work. It is not ours to relicense, and the
MIT grant above does not extend to it.

**If you are not at EDHEC and you fork this:** replace `design/edhec-logo.svg`
with your own mark and change the burgundy `#5F1937` in the token block of each
template. Everything else is yours to use under MIT. Using the EDHEC mark on
work that is not EDHEC's is a trademark matter, not a licence matter, and this
file does not permit it.

The same applies to any other institution's mark you substitute in: check what
your own school or employer allows before you publish.

